  m_text: "Hey! This is a little example of the Figma Unity Bridge - a free tool
    that lets you bring your Figma designs into Unity as native objects. \n\nAll
    of this demo was created in Figma and imported into Unity with 1 click. This
    includes all fonts, bitmaps, shapes, illustrations. screens and even the links
    between screens!\n\nThe tool was made to make prototyping UI elements quick and
    easy and take the pain out of bringing Figma designs into Unity.\n\nThe package
    is open source and free to download. Check the links below for details or click
    these buttons to explore the functionality!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1eeaca52499484a49b2c6adbbfa015f1, type: 2}
